message.content:
{
  "answer_markdown": "To hand off your work from a CLI session to a cloud session (Vibe Code Web), you can use the `/teleport` command in the terminal. This allows you to continue the same coding session in a managed cloud sandbox without keeping your terminal open. The session's history and branch state are preserved during the transition, and you can monitor it from any device signed in to Vibe.\n\n```\n/teleport\n```\n\n### What you give up by using Vibe Code Web instead of the editor surface (CLI or VS Code extension):\n- **Local working tree access**: Vibe Code Web operates in a remote sandbox, so it does not have direct access to your local filesystem or shell. This means you cannot interact with local files, secrets, or unsupported runtimes directly.\n- **Editor context**: You lose features like active file previews, diffs, and source control integration that are available in the VS Code extension.\n- **Local automation and scripting**: The CLI supports non-interactive mode (`vibe --prompt`) for CI and automation, which is not available in Vibe Code Web.\n- **Local terminal and shell access**: The CLI provides full access to your terminal and working tree, which is not replicated in the cloud session.\n\nPrefer Vibe Code Web for tasks that run remotely, take a long time, or end with a branch or pull request. Use the CLI or VS Code extension when your task depends on local files, secrets, or direct machine access.\n\n[1][3][8][9]",
  "citations": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "The CLI is the most flexible surface. It runs in any terminal emulator, supports interactive sessions and scripting, and has full access to your shell and working tree."
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "quote": "Pick Code when the task depends on a codebase, terminal, IDE, or coding session."
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "quote": "Inside an active local session, run:\n\n```text\n/teleport\n```\n\nThe session continues in Vibe Code Web, powered by Mistral Medium 3.5. You can monitor it from any device signed in to Vibe."
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "quote": "Teleport is the cleanest way to escape a local session that has become too long to run on your laptop. The cloud sandbox takes over with the same history and branch."
    }
  ],
  "insufficient_evidence": false
}

