message.content:
{
  "answer_markdown": "If a Workspace in Studio reaches its monthly spending limit, API access for that Workspace is suspended until the next month begins or an admin increases the limit. This is explicitly stated in sources [1], [2], and [3], which also mention that the Organization spending limit acts as a ceiling and cannot be exceeded by any Workspace's spending limit [1, 2, 3].\n\n### Workspace Spending Limit Configuration\nTo configure a Workspace spending limit, follow these steps:\n\n```\n1. Open [Admin Panel > Administration > Workspaces](https://admin.mistral.ai/organization/workspaces).\n2. Select the Workspace.\n3. Open the **Settings** tab.\n4. Enter a value in **Monthly spending limit**.\n5. Save your changes.\n```\n\n[2]\n\n### Organization Spending Limit\nThe Organization spending limit is the maximum cap for API and Vibe consumption across all Workspaces in the Organization. Workspace spending limits cannot exceed this Organization limit [1, 2, 3, 6]. If the Organization reaches its spending limit, API access is suspended for the entire Organization until the next month or until the limit is increased [1, 6].\n\n### API Key Policy\nIf a Workspace's spending limit is set higher than the Organization's limit, the Organization limit becomes the effective ceiling for new API keys. Workspace Admins cannot set a limit higher than the Organization limit, even if they attempt to [4, 5].",
  "citations": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "If the Organization reaches its monthly spending limit, API access can be suspended until the next month begins or an admin increases the limit. If recent invoice payments fail, access can also be affected until the payments are processed again."
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "quote": "If a Workspace reaches its monthly spending limit, API access for that Workspace is suspended until the next month begins or an admin increases the limit. If recent invoice payments fail, access can also be affected until the payments are processed again."
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "quote": "If a Workspace reaches its monthly spending limit, API access for that Workspace is suspended until the next month begins or the limit is increased."
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "quote": "The Organization maximum becomes the effective ceiling for newly created API keys. Workspace Admins can still set stricter limits, but they cannot exceed the Organization maximum."
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "quote": "The Organization policy is the ceiling. Workspace limits can be stricter, but they cannot exceed the Organization maximum."
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "quote": "If the limit is reached, API access can be suspended until the next month begins or an admin increases the limit. If recent invoice payments fail, access can also be affected until the payments are processed again."
    }
  ],
  "insufficient_evidence": false
}

